WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
If you take iron supplements or a multivitamin that contains iron, please stop

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.040
taking them about

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.180
one week before your procedure. Iron can interfere with your bowel prep and

4
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.000
make it harder to see

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.140
clearly during the colonoscopy. Check your multivitamin label too as many

6
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:14.960
contain iron,

7
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.350
even if it's not obvious. If you're unsure whether a specific supplement is

8
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.400
okay to continue,

9
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.360
reach out to your doctor's office before making any changes.
